// The Feud — Asking the gangs + camel-receipt hand-over (chat + inv).
// CANDIDATE 2007-base (OSRS Transcript:The Feud § Asking the gangs / Now we
// have camels minus the 27 Apr 2022 lore pass). Gate: %feud_var >= 1 (Ali M
// start) AND %feud_var_drink >= 3 (three beers, Drunken Ali hop) else return.
// With a feud_camel_receipt (4603) in inv, hand one per gang; leftover
// %feud_var_comp_gangs bits 2-3 of feud_var_multi is 1 thug + 2 bandit = 3
// both. Else the shipped ask-chat. Already-given (this gang's flag) does
// not consume another receipt. Concrete Talk-to faces only — bind the
// visible VARIANTS (feud_arabian_guard1_1/1_2/2_1/2_2 "Bandit"), the
// coward (feud_arabian_guard_coward), and the Menaphite thug
// (feud_egyptian_doorman_1/2). Do NOT bind a multi base. Traitor talk (dump
// §14.2) dispatches on %feud_given_jewels >= 1 (jewels handoff hop) — the
// thug names Traitorous Ali. §19.1 avenge: %feud_var_menaboss >= 1 (Tough Guy
// kill hop) dumps the avenge tree first — "You treacherous jackal!" ... "I
// will avenge my master!" then npc_setmode(opplayer2) (the thug attacks).
// §19.4 celebrate: %feud_var_menaboss >= 1 dispatches first on the bandit
// binds too — "Welcome! Your actions surprise me." ... "So will you run the
// rest of them out of town now?" / "I don't know." Chat only, then return.
// No dest / p_tele / Operator 1902 / 28. No && / ||.
// Cite osrs-wiki-changes-crawl-377.md feud row · Transcript:The Feud.

[opnpc1,feud_arabian_guard1_1]
if (%feud_var < 1) { return; }
if (%feud_var_drink < 3) { return; }
if (%feud_var_menaboss >= 1) {
    @feud_bandit_celebrate;
}
if (%feud_var_comp_gangs = 3) {
    @feud_bandit_after;
}
if (%feud_var_comp_gangs = 2) {
    @feud_bandit_talk;
}
if (inv_total(inv, feud_camel_receipt) >= 1) {
    @feud_bandit_give;
}
@feud_bandit_talk;

