[label,feud_coward_talk]
~chatplayer("<p,neutral>Hello.");
~chatnpc("<p,neutral>What do you want?");
~chatplayer("<p,neutral>I am trying to figure out the feud that exists between you and the Menaphites.");
~chatnpc("<p,neutral>What's it to you?");
~chatplayer("<p,neutral>Nothing much, I'm trying to understand why thieves of your repute would stoop to the level of the Menaphites.");
~chatnpc("<p,neutral>Well if memory serves me correctly. I think my granddad mentioned that they robbed one of our camels. A heinous crime.");
~chatplayer("<p,neutral>So if they offered a camel as a gesture of goodwill would you and the rest of the bandits cease your hostilities?");
~chatnpc("<p,neutral>Those Menaphites would never do that. They have no sense of honour.");
~chatplayer("<p,neutral>But if they did?");
~chatnpc("<p,neutral>I suppose so.");
return;

